<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>be mine?</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">kimmyt</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">be mine?</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">57yy3UD4lLcrN9UwTxUsxJ</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.804" end="00:14.625">Some people say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.625" end="00:17.738">That love isn’t real but you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.738" end="00:20.239">Make me feel some way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.239" end="00:23.455">There’s something happening between us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.455" end="00:26.162">Don’t look at me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.162" end="00:29.280">You know I’m just wasting your time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.280" end="00:31.988">You know I can’t deny</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.988" end="00:35.405">I wanna be right by your side</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.405" end="00:36.909">Boy you must be trippin’</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.909" end="00:38.417">Lately I’ve been thinking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.417" end="00:41.330">I been fallin’ slowly and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.330" end="00:44.245">Sometimes I be wishing and be reminiscing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.245" end="00:47.250">I just wanna be with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.250" end="00:49.751">Please just reply</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.751" end="00:52.657">Before I say goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.657" end="00:55.560">Yes I know you’re the guy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.560" end="00:59.072">Please baby be mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.072" end="01:01.779">I been acting stupid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.779" end="01:04.789">I know you think I’m clueless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.789" end="01:07.593">But every word you say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.593" end="01:10.909">Gets stuck in my brain oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.909" end="01:13.613">And baby I’m so helpless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.613" end="01:16.629">I see you and I’m breathless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.629" end="01:22.744">I want you now cuz you make me feel so warm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.744" end="01:24.250">Boy you must be trippin’</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.250" end="01:25.750">Lately I’ve been thinking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.661" end="01:28.566">I been fallin’ slowly and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.566" end="01:31.677">Sometimes I be wishing and be reminiscing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.677" end="01:34.663">I just wanna be with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.663" end="01:37.181">Please just reply</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.181" end="01:40.086">Before I say goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.086" end="01:42.900">Yes I know you’re the guy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.900" end="01:46.506">Please baby be mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.506" end="01:48.006">Boy you must be trippin’</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.005" end="01:49.505">Lately I’ve been thinking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.417" end="01:52.323">I been fallin’ slowly and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.323" end="01:55.335">Sometimes I be wishing and be reminiscing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.335" end="01:58.452">Can’t believe that I’m with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.452" end="02:00.758">Please just stay mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.758" end="02:03.672">And please say goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.672" end="02:06.586">Yes I know you're the guy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.586" end="02:10.586">Please baby be mine</p></div></body></tt>